{"title":"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadrilateral\" title=\"Quadrilateral\">quadrilateral</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2918f7d23f9ee8c04baabad86100d68023ec03f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_angle\" title=\"Right angle\">right angle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diagonal\" title=\"Diagonal\">diagonal</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perpendicular\" title=\"Perpendicular\">perpendicular</a> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a51ae1b207bc5be14004f5ac59327827f3a3925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/1/ed1c81d6c115b80b9bacee43e8607767c92de967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e893ffe7ab081395bfb3eb1fc2ff71a5001d56df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />. Find the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perimeter\" title=\"Perimeter\">perimeter</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We construct the following diagram: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/6/e065a4745d2a144435bbcb457cecd1e77fc50554.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pathpen = black; pair C=(0,0),D=(0,-14),A=(-sqrt(765),0),B=IP(circle(C,21),circle(A,18)); D(MP(&quot;A&quot;,A,W)--MP(&quot;B&quot;,B,N)--MP(&quot;C&quot;,C,E)--MP(&quot;D&quot;,D,E)--A--C); D(rightanglemark(A,C,D,40)); D(rightanglemark(A,B,C,40)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"235\" />\nUsing the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, we get the following two equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/3/e03e010c17d0e007e3fdd0fb6b0af337f6e6d27e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AD^2 = AC^2 + CD^2\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/6/ff646ee41223da2ea3f0c44c30628991d9d981fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AC^2 = AB^2 + BC^2\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"17\" />\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/d/3cdc7d88eca0d385dad4055c569d700d629b2cd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB^2 + BC^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff3d60c8fd112aac57841ddab6d625dff304193.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC^2$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd4f6805fa8e450c3e94b2a6e5c4513994eb076b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD^2 = AB^2 + BC^2 + CD^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />. Plugging in the given information, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/497073cdaf4cba1d536e24b817aae36fcacf430a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD^2 = 18^2 + 21^2 + 14^2 = 961 \\implies AD = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"357\" height=\"18\" />, so the perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a0f1556a59e8b1a7c4a6b52d5d9cf6b7af0c229.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB+BC+CD+AD = 18+21+14+31 = \\boxed{084}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"411\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I\" title=\"2006 AIME I\">2006 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017085709\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 158/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 115/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3113/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.706      1 -total\n 59.78%    7.595      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.55%    4.898      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2283:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017085709 and revision id 281509. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}